              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba Ruhanga, Omuhangi wa byona, ou ebintu byona byahangiirwe, ku yaayenzire kutaasya abaana baingi omu kitiinisa, kikamushemerera kuhindura Omwebembezi w'okujunwa kwabo kuba ohikire ahabw'obusaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
